  m_Name: Lore8
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: Lore_08
  title: The Lonely Island
  fullText: 'Everything is so quiet here.

    Secluded.

    Lonely.


    This
    island feels...

    Safe.

    Warm.

    Familiar.


    Yet I do not remember
    this place.

    The fog in my mind remains.

    And somehow...

    That troubles
    me more.


    Whatever you do.

    Do not forget...

    Try to Remember.'
